            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.100</h2><ul><li>Fixes Companion readiness checks so the bridge liveness endpoint stays responsive while Powerhouse voice-runtime warmup is running.</li><li>Keeps full Powerhouse/HF diagnostics on their dedicated status endpoints instead of making the basic bridge health check block on heavy runtime inspection.</li><li>Improves accuracy of status banners that previously could report local bridge timeout, stale Tailscale mapping, or old runtime while the current bridge was actually installed and warming.</li></ul>
]]></description>
